    "b0006-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "06e4acf0308131114e108506277c8f7217395c3e17a3ec2dff01d92c7dc3baef",
      "targetHash": "e362a14a9cd5a7b14da0e91ad60ba80e1db1b6285a41ecc89426701d26722993",
      "machineHash": "e362a14a9cd5a7b14da0e91ad60ba80e1db1b6285a41ecc89426701d26722993",
      "machineText": "此問題最常出現在 iOS 上的 Microsoft Remote Desktop 用戶端，該用戶端會在工作階段進行途中佈建針對 Retina 最佳化的虛擬顯示器。任何會在工作階段中途引入具有不同 DPI 上下文之顯示器的 RDP 用戶端，都可能觸發相同行為。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "This is most often seen with the Microsoft Remote Desktop client on iOS, which provisions a Retina-o…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-6-astra",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0007-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "8d892c3c9826b727d4d2be362514e8b2a3cc70ef065ff4d6966df2bc12ca4cfe",
      "targetHash": "087721fb88e9931058afe889a448bc6dfc77ef4d3c8b2f4ef12b4dcb22e36c55",
      "machineHash": "087721fb88e9931058afe889a448bc6dfc77ef4d3c8b2f4ef12b4dcb22e36c55",
      "machineText": "發生原因",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Why it happens",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0008-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "67624803118f6b099746a66d2efc4a1f46e762fd3a0da054a03e27e1b3b5084f",
      "targetHash": "107a666e0b896aebfec05943d9501e70cabe1c7331d36676436f37385d0c1f4e",
      "machineHash": "107a666e0b896aebfec05943d9501e70cabe1c7331d36676436f37385d0c1f4e",
      "machineText": "WebView2 預設使用視窗式裝載，其合成器的繪圖表面位於子視窗中。當 RDP 用戶端引入 DPI 上下文與工作階段不同的顯示器時，每次呼叫 WebView2 控制器（`PutIsVisible`、`MoveFocus`、首次繪製和釋放繪圖表面）都會強制執行同步 DirectComposition 重新封送處理。每次重新封送處理都會封鎖 UI 執行緒約2秒，因此大量使用快顯視窗的應用程式會累積多次停滯。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "By default, WebView2 uses windowed hosting, where its compositor surface lives in a child window. Wh…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-6-astra",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0009-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "37fe272ea2e1484e7161b493827e9fb21e6a97fcf3d25096cbe8623596f2f7de",
      "targetHash": "d2420ba1194157e45d4c2a6e128c83d4d2411524804e9d0ae156f5008277f365",
      "machineHash": "d2420ba1194157e45d4c2a6e128c83d4d2411524804e9d0ae156f5008277f365",
      "machineText": "同一台機器上的原生 Win32 加 WebView2 應用程式不受影響，因為它採用視覺裝載。這表示原因在於裝載模式，而不是一般性的 WebView2 或 Windows 合成器問題。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "A native Win32 plus WebView2 application on the same machine is unaffected, because it relies on vis…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0010-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "22927695994eab589c7601a6b15df4d9dc67c5aceb9a74cdb965444b9b8362a6",
      "targetHash": "a1e576155977cef1c0b0bc81795b8d20ed8875e108ee234b3fd1c64a108dc252",
      "machineHash": "a1e576155977cef1c0b0bc81795b8d20ed8875e108ee234b3fd1c64a108dc252",
      "machineText": "解決方案",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Solution",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0011-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b1ce0771547b1109b1294959f92a86d5dbefb5394e3efcfb49abc303fc199dab",
      "targetHash": "380c1b08d00ea784353d844f447bd25321de24c517b269a52dfc8de92fe39b8b",
      "machineHash": "380c1b08d00ea784353d844f447bd25321de24c517b269a52dfc8de92fe39b8b",
      "machineText": "在 Windows 選項中設定`UseVisualHosting`，以啟用視覺裝載。使用視覺裝載時，主機會透過其擁有的 DirectComposition 視覺物件，持有 WebView2 合成器繪圖表面的擁有權，因此 DPI 上下文變更不再觸發同步重新封送處理。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Enable visual hosting by setting `UseVisualHosting` in your Windows options. With visual hosting, We…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-6-astra",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0012-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "0bd1231730bc139dd76f2ed8b6dd9d56cc4d39706b0106e0f79482d2e038b109",
      "targetHash": "7ff274478207fc9e2368ca34d37857b8a22c0855f74ff40b64651a2e96c60bd9",
      "machineHash": "7ff274478207fc9e2368ca34d37857b8a22c0855f74ff40b64651a2e96c60bd9",
      "machineText": "啟用後，快顯視窗會在正常導覽時間內開啟（約 150 到 500 毫秒），且關閉視窗不再封鎖父視窗。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "After enabling it, popups open within normal navigation time (roughly 150 to 500 ms) and closing a w…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0013-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "1095da597effe3f8682fc0cc28877f584d5f150ee2c7683b436966b82db82087",
      "targetHash": "108d65a327a4cbe5439cdc1da7245a4a43be0725baef4789800beef3330dd124",
      "machineHash": "108d65a327a4cbe5439cdc1da7245a4a43be0725baef4789800beef3330dd124",
      "machineText": "必須在 `app.Run()` 之前設定 `UseVisualHosting`。Wails 會在應用程式啟動期間讀取此設定，並在 WebView2 環境初始化之前，將 `COREWEBVIEW2_FORCED_HOSTING_MODE` 環境變數設為 `COREWEBVIEW2_HOSTING_MODE_WINDOW_TO_VISUAL`。之後才設定不會生效。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`UseVisualHosting` must be set before `app.Run()`. Wails reads it during application startup and set…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
    "b0014-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "6175ac3099231cbf4b322158c3a55f5c5e89aee4c8c43a4737a904aabd7ea1d4",
      "targetHash": "cbaf94098b46baca5b7b435458f8ab32fa46efe0b27c209006cb629da42abdda",
      "machineHash": "cbaf94098b46baca5b7b435458f8ab32fa46efe0b27c209006cb629da42abdda",
      "machineText": "此選項預設為 `false`，因此視窗式裝載仍是預設模式。除非現有應用程式選擇啟用，否則其行為不會改變。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The option defaults to `false`, so windowed hosting remains the default. Existing apps see no change…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:55Z"
    },
